10: import * as i3 from 'angular2-recaptcha/lib/captcha.component';
```

@chuckjaz I have a reproduction setup here: https://github.com/hansl/angular-17389-repro

Steps:
1. `git clone https://github.com/hansl/angular-17389-repro`
1. `cd angular-17389-repro`
1. `npm install`
1. `$(npm bin)/ngc -p src/tsconfig.app.json`

